{"id":"6289a5647fba3d31","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-cardinal-comparison.md","title":"Cardinal Comparison","display":"df-cardinal-comparison — Cardinal Comparison","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cardinal-comparison","aliases":["58-df-cardinal-comparison","Cardinal Comparison"],"display":"df-cardinal-comparison — Cardinal Comparison","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cardinal-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cardinal-comparison</span><span>Cardinal Comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cardinal-comparison — Cardinal Comparison"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span> (set-theoretic parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\)</span> (cardinal assumptions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (injection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}comparison} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\left(\\left(\\kappa \\leq \\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\right)\\land\\left(\\kappa &lt; \\lambda \\leftrightarrow (\\kappa \\leq \\lambda \\land \\kappa \\neq \\lambda)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}comparison} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\left(\\left(\\kappa \\leq \\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\right)\\land\\left(\\kappa &lt; \\lambda \\leftrightarrow (\\kappa \\leq \\lambda \\land \\kappa \\neq \\lambda)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cardinal comparison: use injections, not surjections (dual via power set)</li>\n<li>Cantor-Bernstein gives <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa \\leq \\lambda \\land \\lambda \\leq \\kappa \\to \\kappa=\\lambda\">\\(\\kappa \\leq \\lambda \\land \\lambda \\leq \\kappa \\to \\kappa=\\lambda\\)</span> as a downstream theorem.</li>\n<li>Trichotomy fails in ZF: no trichotomy without choice; but <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa \\leq \\lambda\">\\(\\kappa \\leq \\lambda\\)</span> always defined</li>\n<li>ZFC: all cardinals comparable; total order on cardinals via well-ordering theorem</li>\n<li>Continuum hypothesis: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{c} = 2^{\\aleph_0} = \\aleph_1\">\\(\\mathfrak{c} = 2^{\\aleph_0} = \\aleph_1\\)</span>; not comparable without CH</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Halbeisen, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-injection.md","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)$ (cardinal assumptions, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-injection.md","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (injection predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}comparison} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\left(\\left(\\kappa \\leq \\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\right)\\land\\left(\\kappa < \\lambda \\leftrightarrow (\\kappa \\leq \\lambda \\land \\kappa \\neq \\lambda)\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa \\leq \\lambda \\land \\lambda \\leq \\kappa \\to \\kappa=\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa \\leq \\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{c} = 2^{\\aleph_0} = \\aleph_1","display":false}],"bytes":1659,"backlinks":[{"id":"df2fcf52189a31bd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-cardinal-comparison.md|58-df-cardinal-comparison]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","f5a60b2c6e668b3e"]}